            "title": "Cathie Wood-backed Solmate scoops up solana in last week's drawdown",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Cathie Wood's Ark Invest-backed Solmate Infrastructure said on Tuesday it had picked up cryptocurrency solana during last week's sharp pullback in the market for digital assets. Risk-off sentiment hit cryptocurrencies on Friday as Sino-U.S. tensions flared, triggering the sector's biggest wave of leveraged liquidations, market participants said, with solana tumbling nearly 22% in just two days to a two-month low by Saturday. Solmate said it acquired the token for $50 million, a 15% discount to the market price.",
